cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite its archived release when available."
title: "TheraWeave: Auditable omics evidence for target validation planning"
type: software
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: BSD-3-Clause
authors:
  - name: The TheraWeave Developers
abstract: >-
  A pre-alpha local toolkit for omics evidence import, offline knowledge
  snapshots, transparent experimental prioritisation and versioned validation
  planning. Its rules have not been calibrated on independent biological studies.
